Recommends: xwayland, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Description: MangoWC, a fast tag-based Wayland compositor (dwl-based)
 Lightweight tiling and scrolling Wayland compositor built on wlroots and
 SceneFX, with animations, blur and per-tag layouts. Includes mmsg, its IPC
 tool, which the Armatos shell uses for workspaces.
